
---
const pageTitle = "Windows Cleanup Toolkit";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="description"
    content="Free Windows cleanup and maintenance toolkit from Shaune Drake Tech." />
  <title>{pageTitle} | Shaune Drake Tech</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #0b1220;
      color: #e2e8f0;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body { margin: 0; }

    a {
      color: #38bdf8;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    header {
      padding: 20px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #26364d;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: white;
    }

    .logo span { color: #38bdf8; }

    main { padding-top: 65px; }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
      color: white;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: #94a3b8;
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .panel {
      margin-top: 35px;
      background: #172338;
      border: 1px solid #26364d;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 28px;
    }

    .option {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 18px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #26364d;
    }

    .option:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }

    input[type="checkbox"] {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      accent-color: #0284c7;
    }

    label {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .description {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-top: 5px;
    }

    button {
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      background: #0284c7;
      color: white;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    button:hover { background: #0369a1; }

    .notice {
      margin-top: 24px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header>
    <div class="container">
      <a class="logo" href="/">
        SD<span>.</span> Shaune Drake Tech
      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <a href="/">← Back to Home</a>

    <h1>Windows Cleanup Toolkit</h1>

    <p class="subtitle">
      Create a customized Windows maintenance script.
      Select the cleanup tasks you want, review your choices,
      and generate a PowerShell script.
    </p>

    <div class="panel">
      <h2>Select Cleanup Tasks</h2>

      <div class="option">
        <input type="checkbox" id="temp" checked />
        <div>
          <label for="temp">Temporary Files</label>
          <div class="description">
            Remove eligible files from your user temp folder.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="option">
        <input type="checkbox" id="recycle" />
        <div>
          <label for="recycle">Recycle Bin</label>
          <div class="description">
            Permanently empty the Recycle Bin.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="option">
        <input type="checkbox" id="dns" />
        <div>
          <label for="dns">DNS Cache</label>
          <div class="description">
            Flush cached DNS resolver entries.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <button type="button" disabled
        title="Script generation coming next">
        Generate PowerShell Script — Coming Next
      </button>

      <p class="notice">
        This tool does not access or modify your computer.
        Script generation will be added in the next update.
        Always review scripts before running them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
